# Optional libraries for the Ouroboros braid v2 turn (tools/database_braid_turn.py).
# Never needed by the unit tests or by ci.yml: the braid tools import with the
# standard library only and report UNAVAILABLE when these are absent.
#   szl-receipt-dsse: the estate's canonical receipt library used by the pinned
#     szl-lake adapter (szl-lake/requirements-attest.txt pins the same version).
#   the rest: runtime dependencies declared by hatun-mcp/pyproject.toml, needed
#     for the in-memory MCP session against the committed Hatun server.
# Regenerate the lock: uv pip compile requirements-braid.in --generate-hashes \
#   --python-version 3.12 --python-platform x86_64-manylinux_2_28 -o requirements-braid.lock
